{"author":{"id":"b409816c5cd5ab140d1d52eb33aace35de44952bb794b19806fd57f6ecb1ace9"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1789906055,"nonce":"ShnFLVqChhxW/kDeo0vxi8+n+v4=","title":"Lua: the scanner refuses vertical tab and form feed, \\z across several line breaks, and accepts return;;","message":"full_moon's lexer takes only space, tab and the line-break characters as whitespace, so a chunk with a vertical tab or a form feed between tokens fails to load (literals.lua 9); its \\z escape stops at the first line break where Lua's skips every whitespace character that follows, and the escape decoder stopped at a vertical tab. The vendored parser accepts empty statements anywhere, including after the chunk's return, where the reference wants the end of the chunk (errors.lua 58).","files":null}]}